<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104425" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσσάτιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, late 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόσος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>so great, so much,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.425
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Barb.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Androm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.41
			</span></i>: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσσάτιον</span>
			<i>so wide a tract,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ναίοντες, ὅσον</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				363
			</span></i>; <i>so long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.962
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>so many,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.56
			</span></i>. (No form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσάτιος</span>
		occurs.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
